This modified distribution, created on 2026-11-16, executes the original Arc
libraries in the Rainbow.js VM. Separate host adapters replace the Scheme
host, socket server, disk filesystem, OS background threads, random device,
and password subprocess with Workers APIs, SQLite Durable Object storage,
alarms, and Web Crypto. Compatibility bindings and Arc platform overrides
are in native/. The official Arc files and vendored VM source are preserved.

This supersedes the repository's initial partial TypeScript/D1 rewrite.
It uses a different name to distinguish it from the Standard Version and
does not claim full Arc runtime equivalence or equivalence with the current
Hacker News production service. See README.md for behavior and limitations.
